    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my bosch dishwasher is showing an E15 error code. i looked at the manual but i'm not really sure what i'm doing. how do i check the leak sensor and get the bottom of it dry?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The E15 error in Bosch dishwashers often indicates a leak detection issue. Typically, you need to locate the drain pump area or the bottom of the unit where the sensor is housed. Carefully unplug the dishwasher and then look underneath or at the floor under it to ensure no standing water is present, as this is crucial for drying the sensor area. Once dry, plug it back in and try running a short test cycle to see if the error clears.",
      "source": "target",
